---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { STATS, LOGOS } from '../consts';
const marquee = [...LOGOS, ...LOGOS];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Teleforce — 30-Year BPO, Now EAs | Teleforce"
  description="Teleforce brings 30+ years of Fortune 500 BPO infrastructure to full-time bilingual executive assistants in Latin America, dedicated to U.S. leaders."
>
  <header class="ahead">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cat">About</div>
      <h1>A 30-year operator. Now, your executive assistant.</h1>
      <div class="ameta"><span>Full-time bilingual EAs</span><span>30+ years operating</span></div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <article class="post">
    <p class="lead">Teleforce is the Latin America BPO that has worked with Fortune 500 and U.S. companies for more than 30 years. The infrastructure, processes, training, security, and operating experience from that work now back one offering: a full-time, top tier executive assistant for U.S. leaders.</p>

    <p>What an executive assistant can truly own depends on the system behind them — the recruiting bar, the training, the security posture, the managers who have already run demanding teams. Building that to an enterprise standard takes years of real accounts.</p>

    <p>Teleforce has run that system for three decades. Your EA plugs into it fully formed, and is ready from the first week.</p>

    <img class="about-img" src="/brand/image8.jpg" alt="The Teleforce team" loading="lazy" />

    <h2>A 30-year operator</h2>
    <p>Teleforce has operated for more than 30 years, across 20+ industries, with recruiting, training, quality assurance, information security, and uptime processes built to the standard of large global enterprises. That operation already exists. It now shows up as one dedicated, fully English/Spanish bilingual executive assistant for a U.S. leader.</p>
    <p>When you engage Teleforce, you inherit a system refined across three decades and some of the most demanding accounts in the world — one that runs at full standard from your EA's first week.</p>

    <div class="trust" style="border-radius:14px;margin:30px 0">
      <div class="row">
        {STATS.map((s) => (
          <div class="stat"><span class="n">{s.n}</span><span class="k">{s.k}</span></div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Trusted by global enterprises</h2>
    <p>You'll see names like UPS, American Express, SAP, and Nike among the enterprises Teleforce's operation has supported over 30+ years — proof of the reach and the standard it operates to. That same standard now sits behind a single executive assistant, so a leader gets enterprise-grade operations without having to build them.</p>

    <div class="logos" style="border-radius:14px;margin:24px 0;padding-top:24px">
      <div class="lab">Trusted by global enterprises for 30+ years</div>
      <div class="marquee-mask">
        <div class="marquee">
          {marquee.map((name) => <span>{name}</span>)}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>Why bilingual, why LATAM</h2>
    <p>U.S. leaders work in English, and many also in Spanish. Latin America is one of the few talent pools where native-level Spanish and strong English coexist at scale — on U.S. business hours, with clear, accent-neutral Spanish, and with higher retention than offshore alternatives. Your executive assistant works your hours as a dedicated partner, in the conversation the same day.</p>

    <img class="about-img" src="/brand/image9.jpg" alt="The Teleforce team at work" loading="lazy" />

    <h2>Your EA, employed by Teleforce</h2>
    <p>One model. You are matched with a dedicated, full-time executive assistant, employed and managed by Teleforce. We handle recruiting, training, HR, QA, and management. You get one trusted partner — someone who learns how you work and stays with you. The rate is a flat monthly fee for that one EA. See <a href="/#pricing">pricing</a>, or <a href="/#contact">get matched</a>.</p>

    <h2>A rare layer: U.S. legal oversight</h2>
    <p>Teleforce operates with U.S. legal and compliance oversight of data handling — supervision that's uncommon in this category. An executive assistant works inside calendars, inboxes, and the details of how you run the business and the day. That oversight is why leaders can hand over real responsibility and stand behind the arrangement.</p>

    <div class="cta-box">
      <h4>Get matched.</h4>
      <p>Book a discovery call. We'll cover how you work, fit, and pricing. No commitment on the call.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-amber">Get matched</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
